.TH REGOCHECK 1
.SH NAME
regocheck \\- report local OPA/Rego evaluation readiness
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regocheck
regocheck --policy FILE_OR_DIRECTORY [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Detects a local OPA engine and reports readiness. Full policy evaluation requires an explicit decision and input contract.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBregocheck --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
